Anansi is open-core: the license below (MIT) covers the memory engine, the
public API, all SDKs, and everything needed to self-host. A separate set of
files under the "Enterprise Edition" surface — enterprise auth (SSO/SAML),
SCIM provisioning, audit/governance/redaction, team management, and the
hosted control plane (billing, staff ops console) — is licensed instead under
LICENSE-EE. Each of those files carries its own header naming LICENSE-EE; see
README.md's "License" section for the full path list. Everything else in this
repository is MIT.

